1
00:03:57,272 --> 00:04:03,272
Your favorite movies are going to be destroyed.

2
00:07:54,545 --> 00:08:00,545
Disaster Movie is a comedy, science fiction film directed by Jason Friedberg.

3
00:11:51,818 --> 00:11:57,818
Over the course of one evening, an unsuspecting group of twenty-somethings find
themselves bombarded by a series of natural disasters and catastrophic events.

4
00:15:49,090 --> 00:15:55,090
Will, played by Matt Lanter.

5
00:19:46,363 --> 00:19:52,363
Amy, played by Vanessa Lachey.

6
00:23:43,636 --> 00:23:49,636
Calvin, played by Gary 'G. Thang' Johnson.

7
00:27:40,909 --> 00:27:46,909
Enchanted Princess / Amy Winehouse Look-A-Like / Jessica
Simpson Look-A-Like, played by Nicole Parker.

8
00:31:38,181 --> 00:31:44,181
Juney / Hannah Montana, played by Crista Flanagan.

9
00:35:35,454 --> 00:35:41,454
Lisa, played by Kim Kardashian.

10
00:39:32,727 --> 00:39:38,727
Disaster Movie is a 2008 American parody film written and directed by Jason Friedberg
and Aaron Seltzer and produced by Peter Safran, Friedberg, and Seltzer.

11
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:36,000
It stars Matt Lanter, Vanessa Minnillo, Gary "G Thang" Johnson, Crista Flanagan, Nicole Parker, Ike
Barinholtz, Carmen Electra, Tony Cox, and Kim Kardashian in her feature film debut.

12
00:47:27,272 --> 00:47:33,272
The film is mainly a parody of the disaster film genre, although it also references many
other films, television shows, people, and pop culture events of the time.

13
00:51:24,545 --> 00:51:30,545
Initially intended as a parody of Superbad, directors Friedberg and Seltzer transitioned
the film as a satire of the disaster movie genre midway through production.

14
00:55:21,818 --> 00:55:27,818
The directors also reportedly used trailer footage to get
an understanding of then upcoming films.

15
00:59:19,090 --> 00:59:25,090
Filming took place from April to June 2008, with the title getting
revealed on the final day of the film's production.

16
01:03:16,363 --> 01:03:22,363
The film was theatrically released by Lionsgate in the United States on August 29, 2008, and was universally panned by
critics and audiences, with many considering it to be the worst "movie" directed by Friedberg and Seltzer.

17
01:07:13,636 --> 01:07:19,636
The film is often listed as one of the lowest-rated films of the
2000s, and one of the worst films of all time.

18
01:11:10,909 --> 01:11:16,909
It was also a financial disappointment compared to Friedberg and Seltzer's
previous films, grossing $34.8 million on $20 million budget.

19
01:15:08,181 --> 01:15:14,181
At the 29th Golden Raspberry Awards, the film received six nominations.

20
01:19:05,454 --> 01:19:11,454
The film explores themes of transvestite, natural
disaster, parody, stupidity, spoof.

21
01:23:02,727 --> 01:23:08,727
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
